04:27:46.066 --> 04:27:47.034
OPERATIONS THAT HAVE BEEN PART

04:27:47.034 --> 04:27:48.502
OF THE HISTORY AND ECONOMY OF

04:27:48.502 --> 04:27:50.704
THIS REGION FOR GENERATIONS.

04:27:50.704 --> 04:27:52.339
